ることがあり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「好きな相手には自分をさらけ出してみたらどうかな」 というアドバイスを受け、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"全裸でアピールしてきたりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「はい。 立派な獣医さんになるのが夢なので、しっかり頑張ります」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"56356"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好きな食べ物","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"56356","value":"フルーツ"},{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"56356","value":"1年"},{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"56356","value":"動物と会話ができる（と思っている）"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"56356","value":"裁縫（腕前は……）"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/33/33135cca00cd41612229899aaa9c7073536daa2b3dc304684f57dc8368b49e76.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/07/07fbdc9fcf92047c1c0bd5688ab582863592bf1bdc4bb7b152697d9f37939b4d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榎木実佳","creatorId":"vndb:s987","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s987","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s987","name":"榎木 実佳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:220173:56356:10026:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c62936","characterName":"氷上 あやめ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"56357","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"220173"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17120"],"vndbCharacterId":"c62936"},"originalCharacterName":"氷上 あやめ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"なかなか授業に出てこない、病気がちで儚げなお嬢様……だと思われているが、実は単なる引きこもりで、全くの健康体。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"リアルの予定はゲーム基準に組み込み、出席日数はギリギリで調整している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"黒猫を飼っており、体調管理のためにペット食堂にはちょくちょく出入りしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本的にリアルの世界には興